<title>UK: National Power sets 200 mln stg 25-yr bond.</title>
<headline>National Power sets 200 mln stg 25-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL POWER PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    09.JUN.22</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+93 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
