<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2021 GILT</p>
